          "id": 479689439,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Looks like www.soft-switch.org site is back online.  The main link https://www.soft-switch.org does not take one to any of the telco related pages, but they still maintain the old downloads folder at https://www.soft-switch.org/downloads/ and more specifically the tar gzipped spandsp source files.\n\nClosing this merge request for now.",
